WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.740
- You're living in Australia now?

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:03.180
- I am.
- I love Australia,

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:04.470
it's literally my favorite place

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:05.820
outside of the United States.

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:06.668
- Is it?
- Yeah.

00:00:06.668 --> 00:00:08.490
I love it, yeah, I feel
very lucky to be there.

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:10.200
- Yeah, and you're in Perth?

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.033
- [Kate] Yeah, Perth.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:12.690
- That's the most remote place ever.

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:15.210
- It's literally the most
remote city in the world.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:16.043
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:16.043 --> 00:00:16.876
- So good luck finding me, yeah, yeah.

00:00:16.876 --> 00:00:18.060
(audience laughing)

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.920
- Don't challenge them,

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:21.690
don't challenge them.
- They're like "Hey."

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:23.040
- Well, congrats on the engagement.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.630
How did you end up telling everybody?

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.070
- How did I end up telling, well, this is,

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:26.903
okay, so I--

00:00:26.903 --> 00:00:27.736
- [Kelly] I heard it was an accident.

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:30.294
- I'm engaged to be married
to an Australian gentleman.

00:00:30.294 --> 00:00:31.440
(audience awing)

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:32.512
(audience clapping)
- Yeah.

00:00:32.512 --> 00:00:33.929
- [Kate] Isn't he gorgeous?

00:00:33.929 --> 00:00:35.220
- [Kelly] He is.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:37.440
- He's very handsome, he's very sweet,

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:38.273
he's the best.

00:00:38.273 --> 00:00:41.850
So I did, I inadvertently
outed our engagement.

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:42.990
We kept it very quiet,

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:45.840
and I was doing an Instagram
Live with Amy Brennaman,

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:47.970
and he just came walking through the door,

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:49.830
in like a singlet, he'd just worked out.

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:51.817
I go "Oh, there he is now,

00:00:51.817 --> 00:00:54.240
"the jungle cat himself,
my Aussie fiance."

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:56.486
And she's like, "You just outed him."

00:00:56.486 --> 00:00:57.319
(audience laughing)
- Yeah.

00:00:57.319 --> 00:00:58.152
- "You realize that?"

00:00:58.152 --> 00:00:59.047
You know, when you're
on Instagram you think,

00:00:59.047 --> 00:01:00.960
"Oh, we're just having
a chat with my lady,"

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:01.793
and you're like--

00:01:01.793 --> 00:01:03.870
- Literally just did the
same thing with something.

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:06.180
Then you're like, "Oh my
God, it's live, we're live."

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:07.013
- Yeah, yeah.
(audience laughing)

00:01:07.013 --> 00:01:09.150
- It's live, so it's done now.

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:10.230
- Yeah, it is, it's done.

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:11.430
You're like, "Oh, welcome," yeah.

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:12.750
- Totally said something I shouldn't have,

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:14.190
and I was like, "Well, whatever."

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:15.067
- Exactly.
(audience laughing)

00:01:15.067 --> 00:01:16.470
- "You should be used to it by now."

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:17.730
- Yeah, exactly.

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:19.650
It must be what the universe wanted, so.

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:23.657
- What's, I like about--
(Kate laughing)

